# The packages of the lens tests and of the CLI's lens and ASA tests (the
# services/geometric-lens/tests and tests/atlas subsets of test.yml), from a hashed lock:
# the CPU-only torch from PyTorch's index, the lens service's requirements, and
# huggingface_hub, which `atlas lens publish` and `atlas asa publish` take when
# it is installed. A package that ci.txt also holds keeps its version there,
# because the job installs ci.txt first.
# Make lens.txt again with scripts/ci/ci-lock.sh.
--index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu
--extra-index-url https://pypi.org/simple
-c ci.txt
-r ../../services/geometric-lens/requirements.txt
huggingface_hub
